{
  "name": "Deal alerts to Slack (Slickdeals, hotukdeals, OzBargain)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deal alerts to Slack\n\nEvery 30 minutes, posts **new** community deals matching your keywords to a Slack channel, using the [Deal Scraper](https://apify.com/Smart-Shopping-Data/deal-community-scraper) Apify Actor.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (Apify Console → Settings → API & Integrations).\n2. Edit the keywords, sources and minimum score in **Get new deals**.\n3. Connect Slack and pick your channel in **Post to Slack**.\n\nOnly deals not sent before are returned (`onlyNew`), so each deal is posted once. Cost: $0.001 per deal returned.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every 30 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/7e7KW09J9d6LPGucb/run-sync-get-dataset-items?timeout=120",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"sources\": [\n    \"slickdeals-frontpage\",\n    \"hotukdeals-hot\",\n    \"ozbargain-new\"\n  ],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"laptop\",\n    \"lego\",\n    \"headphones\"\n  ],\n  \"minScore\": 20,\n  \"onlyNew\": true,\n  \"stateName\": \"n8n-slack-alerts\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 150000
        }
      },
      "name": "Get new deals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token (Authorization: Bearer ...)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#deals",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ ($json.country === 'US' ? '🇺🇸' : $json.country === 'UK' ? '🇬🇧' : '🇦🇺') + ' *' + $json.title + '*\\n' + ($json.price !== null ? '💰 ' + $json.price + ' ' + $json.currency + '  ' : '') + ($json.store ? '🏬 ' + $json.store + '  ' : '') + '📈 ' + $json.score + ' on ' + $json.site + '\\n' + $json.url }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 30 minutes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get new deals",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get new deals": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}